          },
          "prompt": "$$X(z) = \\frac{z(z - {{c||4}})}{z^2 - {{2*c||4}}z + {{a^2||4}}}$$\nis a damped cosine $a^n\\cos(\\Omega n)\\,u[n]$.",
          "ask": [
